@@ -173,4 +173,16 @@ We enforce the OWASP BLT ecosystem quality standards:
    npx wrangler dev
    ```
 
+### Optional BLT Chat triage notifications
+
+To receive terminal-state triage and safety-quarantine alerts, create an Incoming Webhook in BLT Chat and configure it as a Cloudflare secret.
+The webhook URL is sensitive and must not be committed to source control.
+
+```bash
+npx wrangler secret put BLT_CHAT_WEBHOOK_URL --env staging
+npx wrangler secret put BLT_CHAT_WEBHOOK_URL --env production
+```
+
+When the secret is unset, Toasty continues without sending BLT Chat notifications.
+
 For full details, please refer to the `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the documentation in the `docs/` folder.
